= DPW2025 - Digital Public Works 2025 =

'''DPW2025''' is a structured mapping initiative supporting 61 youth mappers in informal settlements around Nairobi, Kenya. The project runs from January through March 2026, focusing on building digital literacy and contributing quality building data to OpenStreetMap.

== Project Overview ==

'''Goal:''' Map buildings in underserved informal settlements while training local youth in digital mapping skills.

'''Duration:''' January - March 2026

'''Locations:''' Three informal settlements in Nairobi:
* Kayole (28 mappers)
* Kariobangi Machakos (22 mappers)
* Mji wa Huruma (11 mappers)

'''Total Mappers:''' 61 active digitizers

== Methodology ==

=== Task Management ===
* All mapping is conducted through [https://tasks.hotosm.org/ HOT Tasking Manager]
* Mappers work on assigned tasks in their respective settlements
* Tasks are distributed to ensure even coverage and prevent duplication

=== Quality Control Measures ===
* '''Daily limit:''' 200 buildings per mapper (quality over quantity)
* Tasks may span multiple days due to this limit
* Incomplete tasks are resumed the next day or by another mapper
* All work is validated by trained validators before marking complete
* Regular feedback sessions with mappers

=== Workflow ===
# Mapper selects/is assigned a HOTOSM task
# Maps buildings using approved imagery sources
# Stops at 200 buildings (even if task incomplete)
# Validator reviews and provides feedback
# Task marked complete or returned for fixes
# Incomplete tasks resumed next day

== Data Sources ==

All mapping uses approved high-resolution imagery:
* '''Bing Aerial Imagery''' (available through iD/JOSM editors)
* '''Maxar Premium Imagery''' (accessed via HOTOSM)
* Field surveys conducted where aerial imagery is unclear

'''Note:''' We do NOT use Mapbox imagery. Previous incorrect source tags have been corrected.

== Changeset Comment Format ==

All changesets follow this standardized format:

<code>
DPW2025: [Settlement Name] - HOTOSM Task #[number] - [status]
Source: [Bing/Maxar via HOTOSM]
Info: https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/DPW2025_Nairobi_Informal_Settlements
</code>

'''Examples:'''
* <code>DPW2025: Kayole - HOTOSM Task #12345 - Complete</code>
* <code>DPW2025: Huruma - HOTOSM Task #12346 - Partial (daily limit reached)</code>
* <code>DPW2025: Kariobangi - HOTOSM Task #12347 - Validation fixes</code>

== Validation Process ==

=== Validator Training ===
All validators have completed:
* OSM mapping fundamentals
* Quality assurance procedures
* Common error identification
* Feedback delivery techniques

=== Validation Checklist ===
* Geometry accuracy (buildings aligned to imagery)
* Proper tagging (<code>building=yes</code>, <code>building=residential</code>, etc.)
* No duplicate features
* Connectivity to roads where appropriate
* Proper source attribution

=== Daily Reports ===
* Building counts tracked per mapper
* Quality metrics monitored
* Issues addressed in training sessions

