== Project Impact ==

=== Community Benefits ===
* '''Skills Development:''' 61 youth trained in GIS and digital mapping
* '''Local Knowledge:''' Mappers live in the settlements they map, ensuring accuracy
* '''Employment:''' Providing income opportunities for youth in underserved areas
* '''Data for Good:''' Improving base maps for urban planning, disaster response, and service delivery

=== Mapping Goals ===
* Complete building mapping in three informal settlements
* Create reliable baseline data for population estimation
* Support infrastructure planning and improvement
* Enable better emergency response coordination

